// https://learn.microsoft.com/windows-hardware/drivers/ddi/wdm/nf-wdm-keacquireinterruptspinlock
// Object-dependent synchronization DIRQL and release ownership remain in the
// interrupt model; Any is only the outer x64 valid-IRQL ceiling.
